.TH "bead schema show" 1  "bead schema show " 
.SH NAME
bead schema show \- Show a public JSON Schema
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbead schema show\fR [\fB\-\-format\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fISCHEMA_REF\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Emit the immutable JSON Schema Draft 2020\-12 document for an exact catalog identity.
.PP
Schema resolution is workspace\-independent. Unknown identities are usage errors.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-format\fR=\fIFORMAT\fR [default: json]
Output format
.br

.br
[\fIpossible values: \fRjson]
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
<\fISCHEMA_REF\fR>
Exact schema identity
